WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
No matter how Dugu got it

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,040
What does it have to do with us?

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,840
Isn’t it okay if we can survive with enough food?

4
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,080
Let me tell you the truth

5
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,360
To seek defeat alone is to destroy you

6
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,520
Staying in the manuscript and acting like a fool

7
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:09,680
And those food are all from

8
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:10,680
Picked up from the garbage dump

9
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:13,610
No need to pay for real or fake ones.

10
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:15,010
No wonder I have diarrhea after eating it

11
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:17,010
I thought it was a problem I often have, really

12
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:18,610
Today I met a war code

13
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:20,050
You have to pay five survival coins when you go in.

14
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:21,530
There is a huge garbage dump inside

15
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:24,130
Whatever you pick up is free, so Mr. Dugu

16
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:25,290
On free rubbish

17
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:26,890
Thousands of ingredients were transferred to us in one bowl

18
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:28,610
I also reduced a lot of supplies

19
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,730
But I'm not as black-hearted as some people

20
00:00:31,330 --> 00:00:32,410
Three ingredients per serving

21
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:34,330
This is three times cheaper than Dugu Survival.

22
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:37,950
Everyone, hurry up and sing together

23
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:40,070
I didn’t know you guys were in the same group when you were fat?

24
00:00:40,630 --> 00:00:42,550
Seven days expired banana milk bread

25
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:44,470
After eating, you will lose three health points.

26
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:46,590
Pickled pepper chicken feet that have expired for 13 days

27
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:48,550
After eating, four health points will be lost.
